%% SEQ-01: Startup and capability readiness
%% Behavior trace is in 02_Requirements/AIOS_Requirement_Behavior_Traceability.csv
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant SD as systemd
    participant RT as Runtime Supervisor
    participant CFG as Reviewed Host Profile
    participant PROBE as Linux Capability Probe
    participant POL as Policy Gate
    participant DB as Local State DB
    SD->>RT: Start services
    RT->>CFG: Load reviewed configuration
    CFG-->>RT: Valid, invalid, or missing profile
    RT->>PROBE: Probe Ubuntu, kernel, cgroup v2, PSI and optional eBPF
    PROBE-->>RT: Per-feature capability status
    RT->>POL: Initialize mode and safety health
    alt Valid configuration and required checks pass
        POL-->>RT: OBSERVE_ONLY at startup/restart
        RT->>DB: Record readiness and capability report
    else Invalid profile or failed safety health
        POL-->>RT: Fail closed and disable unsupported/control features
        RT->>DB: Record degraded state and reason
    end
    RT-->>SD: Publish service health
